# 安装与配置 MosDNS (适配 v5.3.4+ 最新版本)

> MosDNS 是一款高度可定制、极速并发的 DNS 分流与转发器。在旁路由架构中，MosDNS 负责监听 `127.0.0.1:5335`，执行国内直连域名与国外分流域名的分流判定、缓存加速及防污染解析。

---

## 1. 下载与安装最新版 MosDNS

当前 MosDNS 最新稳定版为 **v5.3.4**（可通过 GitHub API 自动匹配最新版本）：

```bash
# 1. 创建工作目录
mkdir -p /etc/mosdns
cd /tmp

# 2. 自动获取并下载最新稳定版 Linux amd64 二进制包
MOSDNS_URL=$(curl -fsSL https://api.github.com/repos/IrineSistiana/mosdns/releases/latest | jq -r ".assets[] | select(.name=="mosdns-linux-amd64.zip") | .browser_download_url")
wget -O mosdns.zip "${MOSDNS_URL:-https://github.com/IrineSistiana/mosdns/releases/download/v5.3.4/mosdns-linux-amd64.zip}"

# 3. 解压并安装到系统路径
unzip -o mosdns.zip -d /tmp/mosdns_tmp
mv /tmp/mosdns_tmp/mosdns /usr/local/bin/mosdns
chmod +x /usr/local/bin/mosdns
rm -rf mosdns.zip /tmp/mosdns_tmp

# 验证安装
mosdns version
```

---

## 2. 配置 Systemd 守护服务

创建并配置 `/etc/systemd/system/mosdns.service`：

```ini
[Unit]
Description=MosDNS Daemon
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=root
WorkingDirectory=/etc/mosdns
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/mosdns start -c /etc/mosdns/config.yaml -d /etc/mosdns
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5
LimitNOFILE=65535

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

```bash
# 重新加载守护服务
systemctl daemon-reload
```

---

## 3. 下载国内外分流规则与 IP 库

进入 `/etc/mosdns` 目录并拉取最新规则文件：

```bash
cd /etc/mosdns

# 国内直连域名列表 (Loyalsoldier 维护)
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/release/direct-list.txt -o /etc/mosdns/geosite_cn.txt

# 国内 IP 段 CIDR 列表
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Hackl0us/GeoIP2-CN/release/CN-ip-cidr.txt -o /etc/mosdns/geoip_cn.txt

# 常用非大陆域名列表
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/release/proxy-list.txt -o /etc/mosdns/geosite_geolocation_noncn.txt

# GFW 被封锁域名列表
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/release/gfw.txt -o /etc/mosdns/gfw.txt

# 创建自定义 Hosts 文件 (备用)
touch /etc/mosdns/hosts.txt
```

---

## 4. 编写 MosDNS 配置文件 (`/etc/mosdns/config.yaml`)

编辑 `/etc/mosdns/config.yaml`：

```bash
nano /etc/mosdns/config.yaml
```

写入以下经过优化的 v5 标准配置：

```yaml
log:
  level: info
  file: "/etc/mosdns/mosdns.log"

plugins:
  # 1. 规则集加载
  - tag: "direct_domain"
    type: domain_set
    args:
      files:
        - "/etc/mosdns/geosite_cn.txt"

  - tag: "direct_ip"
    type: ip_set
    args:
      files:
        - "/etc/mosdns/geoip_cn.txt"

  - tag: "hosts"
    type: hosts
    args:
      files:
        - "/etc/mosdns/hosts.txt"

  # 2. 高速内存缓存
  - tag: "cache"
    type: cache
    args:
      size: 65536
      lazy_cache_ttl: 86400
      dump_file: "/etc/mosdns/cache.dump"

  # 3. 上游 DNS 服务器配置
  # 国内上游 (直连，低延迟)：可指定为阿里DNS、DNSPod，或局域网主路由/防火墙
  - tag: "local_forward"
    type: forward
    args:
      concurrent: 2
      upstreams:
        - addr: "223.5.5.5:53"
        - addr: "119.29.29.29:53"

  # 国外上游 (防污染，走 TLS 或上层代理)：可配置 DoT (如 Google/Cloudflare)，或本地专用解析器
  - tag: "remote_forward"
    type: forward
    args:
      concurrent: 2
      upstreams:
        - addr: "tls://8.8.8.8:853"
        - addr: "tls://1.1.1.1:853"

  # 4. 执行流程序列
  - tag: "ttl_sequence"
    type: sequence
    args:
      - exec: ttl 600-3600
      - exec: accept

  - tag: "local_sequence"
    type: sequence
    args:
      - exec: query_summary local_forward
      - exec: $local_forward
      - exec: goto ttl_sequence

  - tag: "remote_sequence"
    type: sequence
    args:
      - exec: query_summary remote_forward
      - exec: $remote_forward
      - matches: "resp_ip $direct_ip"
        exec: goto local_sequence
      - exec: goto ttl_sequence

  - tag: "final"
    type: fallback
    args:
      primary: remote_sequence
      secondary: local_sequence
      threshold: 500
      always_standby: true

  - tag: "main_sequence"
    type: sequence
    args:
      - exec: prefer_ipv4
      - exec: $hosts
      - exec: $cache
      - matches: has_resp
        exec: accept
      - matches: "qname $direct_domain"
        exec: goto local_sequence
      - exec: $final

  # 5. 服务入站 (监听 127.0.0.1:5335，供 daed 调用)
  - tag: udp_server
    type: udp_server
    args:
      entry: main_sequence
      listen: "127.0.0.1:5335"

  - tag: tcp_server
    type: tcp_server
    args:
      entry: main_sequence
      listen: "127.0.0.1:5335"
```

---

## 5. 启动与管理服务

```bash
# 启动并设置开机自启
systemctl enable mosdns --now

# 检查服务状态
systemctl status mosdns

# 测试本地解析 (查询 5335 端口)
dig @127.0.0.1 -p 5335 baidu.com
dig @127.0.0.1 -p 5335 google.com
```

---

## 6. 配置规则库每日自动更新

创建 `/etc/mosdns/mos_rule_update.sh`：

```bash
cat > /etc/mosdns/mos_rule_update.sh <<\x27EOF\x27
#!/bin/bash
set -e

download() {
  local url="$1"
  local dest="$2"
  local tmp="$dest.tmp"
  if curl -fsSL "$url" -o "$tmp"; then
    mv -f "$tmp" "$dest"
    echo "$dest 更新成功"
  else
    echo "$url 下载失败" >&2
  fi
}

download "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/release/direct-list.txt" "/etc/mosdns/geosite_cn.txt"
download "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Hackl0us/GeoIP2-CN/release/CN-ip-cidr.txt" "/etc/mosdns/geoip_cn.txt"
download "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/release/proxy-list.txt" "/etc/mosdns/geosite_geolocation_noncn.txt"
download "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/release/gfw.txt" "/etc/mosdns/gfw.txt"

# 重启 mosdns 使新规则生效
systemctl restart mosdns
EOF

chmod +x /etc/mosdns/mos_rule_update.sh
```

添加每日定时任务 (`crontab -e`)：

```text
0 4 * * * /etc/mosdns/mos_rule_update.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
```
